# Documentation And Task Governance

- Keep implementation work aligned with task docs, runbooks, and research-backed decisions.
- Update documentation when behavior, architecture, workflows, or operational steps materially change.
- Reuse the repo's task-template structure for substantial scoped work.
- Record strict rules, out-of-scope items, and definition-of-done expectations for complex tasks.
- Prefer traceable changes over undocumented agent-only decisions.
